<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着人工智能的出现，股票抛售将继续球员再次倒下</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html</link><description>由于投资者还担心关税和利率，英伟达、Anthropic 和其他科技公司的股价在盘前交易中暴跌，延续前一交易日的跌势。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html'&gt;随着人工智能的出现，股票抛售将继续球员再次倒下&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Slump Again as Investors Fret About A.I., Tariffs and Inflation&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:32:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>传闻中 Nvidia 股价飙升 3 亿美元并无交易记录支持</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/nvidia-stock-insider-trading-rumor.html</link><description>三个数据提供商表示，他们没有证据支持网上声称的内幕交易产生 9,000% 回报的说法。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/nvidia-stock-insider-trading-rumor.html'&gt;传闻中 Nvidia 股价飙升 3 亿美元并无交易记录支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：A Rumored $300 Million Score on Nvidia’s Stock Surge Isn’t Backed by Trading Records&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/nvidia-stock-insider-trading-rumor.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:36:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</link><description>最近几天股市的回落表明，特朗普总统推动重新任命公司首席执行官的努力与他其他政策的现实发生了冲突。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html'&gt;特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Rejoiced in the Market’s Nvidia Surge. It Didn’t Last Long.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:53:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>梅西百货感恩节大游行影响游客假期计划</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-tourists.html</link><description>由于强风暴袭击纽约，游行被推迟到周六，届时该市的许多游客计划前往其他地方。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-tourists.html'&gt;梅西百货感恩节大游行影响游客假期计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade Sours Holiday Plans for Tourists&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-tourists.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:24:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周六感恩节游行。他们能做到吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html</link><description>经过一个多世纪的传统后，梅西百货感恩节游行突然变得灵活起来。当然，这很好。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html'&gt;周六感恩节游行。他们能做到吗？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Thanksgiving Parade on Saturday. Can They Do That?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:45:29 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>